window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-019-bf2f6e0effae1e70.json"]={sha256:"bf2f6e0effae1e70ae1d7556027942c3f35fccde07a5ad38d8563767b634bb9a",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-2ba59bdc35375ccb","url":"https://docs.kernel.org/admin-guide/mm/transhuge.html","title":"Transparent Hugepage Support","titleEn":"Transparent Hugepage Support","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-019","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-019","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-020","referenceUrls":["https://kernel.org/doc/html/latest/kernel-hacking/false-sharing.html"],"title":"Linux false sharing：寫入序列的擁有權轉移","titleEn":"Linux false sharing: ownership transitions in a write trace","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付單位換算、兩種頁面表、64 MiB 視窗判定與容量足夠但衝突的反例；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver unit conversions, both page configurations, the working-window decision and a conflict counterexample. State explicitly which assumptions prevent the reach calculation from being a direct performance forecast. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"輸入 writer_core、counter_id、address 與序號；以教學 64-byte 線切分地址，依每線維護前一個 writer。","differenceEn":"Input writer_core, counter_id, address and sequence number. Map addresses to synthetic 64-byte lines and retain the previous writer separately for each line; do not compare writers across unrelated lines.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["理想完全相聯且同頁面大小的 reach 為 entry_count*page_size；比較工作視窗時必須使用相同二進位單位；假設兩個獨立配置都可使用 64 個對應頁面大小的 entry；名義頁面 2 MiB，變更 4 KiB；名義式 64*2 = 128 MiB；變更式 64*4/1024 = 0.25 MiB。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","簡化模型中，同一線的連續寫入若換了核心便計一次擁有權轉移；初次取得不計，模型不含協定細節與寫入合併；八個核心輪流各寫一次，重複一千輪，共 8000 次；名義八計數器同線，變更每核心一條獨立線；名義式 8*1000-1 = 7999 modeled transitions；變更式 8*0 = 0 modeled transitions。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Under a fully associative, single-page-size idealization, reach equals entry count times page size. Use consistent binary units and keep this capacity bound distinct from measured miss behavior. Assume two hypothetical configurations each provide 64 entries for the relevant page size. Pages change from 2 MiB to 4 KiB; this does not assert any real processor has identical capacities for both sizes. Nominal 64*2 = 128 MiB; changed 64*4/1024 = 0.25 MiB. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","In the simplified model, successive writes to the same line count one ownership transition when the writer core changes. Initial acquisition is excluded, as are coherence protocol details and write combining. Eight cores write in round-robin order for one thousand rounds, totaling 8000 writes. Initially all counters share one line; after padding, each core owns a separate line with the same update sequence. Nominal 8*1000-1 = 7999 modeled transitions; changed 8*0 = 0 modeled transitions. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-029","referenceUrls":["https://docs.kernel.org/networking/timestamping.html"],"title":"PTP 時戳：單向延遲的時鐘不確定界","titleEn":"PTP timestamps: clock uncertainty in one-way latency","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付單位換算、兩種頁面表、64 MiB 視窗判定與容量足夠但衝突的反例；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver unit conversions, both page configurations, the working-window decision and a conflict counterexample. State explicitly which assumptions prevent the reach calculation from being a direct performance forecast. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"記錄 send_clock、receive_clock、時戳來源層級、offset_bound 與校時時間；拒絕混用軟體與硬體時間戳而不註記。","differenceEn":"Record sending and receiving clock identities, timestamping layer, offset bound and synchronization age. Mark mixed software and hardware timestamps explicitly instead of treating them as interchangeable observations.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["理想完全相聯且同頁面大小的 reach 為 entry_count*page_size；比較工作視窗時必須使用相同二進位單位；假設兩個獨立配置都可使用 64 個對應頁面大小的 entry；名義頁面 2 MiB，變更 4 KiB；名義式 64*2 = 128 MiB；變更式 64*4/1024 = 0.25 MiB。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","若觀察差值 d、兩時鐘差的絕對誤差界 e，真實延遲位於 [d-e,d+e]；負下界表示無法辨識正延遲而非真的逆時；觀察單向差值 10 微秒；相對時鐘誤差界由 2 增為 8 微秒；數值檢查計算下界；名義式 10-2 = 8 microseconds lower bound；變更式 10-8 = 2 microseconds lower bound。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Under a fully associative, single-page-size idealization, reach equals entry count times page size. Use consistent binary units and keep this capacity bound distinct from measured miss behavior. Assume two hypothetical configurations each provide 64 entries for the relevant page size. Pages change from 2 MiB to 4 KiB; this does not assert any real processor has identical capacities for both sizes. Nominal 64*2 = 128 MiB; changed 64*4/1024 = 0.25 MiB. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","For observed difference d and a bound e on relative clock error, true latency lies between d-e and d+e. A negative lower bound signals insufficient timing certainty, not backward packet travel. Observe a 10-microsecond timestamp difference. Relative clock uncertainty changes from 2 to 8 microseconds; the numeric checks calculate the lower endpoint, with upper endpoints retained in the evidence table. Nominal 10-2 = 8 microseconds lower bound; changed 10-8 = 2 microseconds lower bound. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-d78e76d901c6709c","url":"https://kernel.org/doc/html/latest/kernel-hacking/false-sharing.html","title":"False Sharing","titleEn":"False Sharing","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-931f803098f1b483","url":"https://docs.kernel.org/networking/timestamping.html","title":"Timestamping","titleEn":"Timestamping","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
